# Cryptography + Vault

- AES-GCM with random IV per encryption, scrypt-derived key from password + salt
- Vault lifecycle: hasPassword -> setPassword/unlock -> operations -> lock
- Operations requiring decrypted state must fail fast when locked
- NEVER log: mnemonic, password, private keys, derived key bytes
- Any edit to src/cryptography.ts -> flag for security review in PR
- Keep memory zeroing where currently implemented
- Password policy enforcement must remain explicit and deterministic
- Mnemonic validation: strict 24-word policy
